{
  "_doc": "Single source of truth for layouts. Every layout reads the same flat SlideContent; `fields` lists what it uses and the hard text limits (characters). Used by the React components, the Gemini prompts/schemas and validation. `variants` are the arrangements the AI (or the user) can pick per slide; the first is the default. `pos` is where the title sits, used to keep neighbouring slides from looking alike.",
